language design-core version 0.5.
activity ABuild.
activity AIsolated.
activity APlan.
activity AVerify.
interface Api.
usecase Browse.
capability Delivery.
unit Desktop.
functionality Display.
usecase Export.
actor Guest.
usecase Isolated.
container Local.
feature Navigation.
mode Offline.
mode Online.
mode Quiet.
actor Reader.
container Remote.
interface SparePort.
unit Standalone.
capability Unconnected.
ABuild addresses Display.
ABuild delivers Navigation.
ABuild has implementation-status = implemented.
ABuild refines APlan.
APlan has implementation-status = planned.
AVerify depends-on ABuild.
AVerify has implementation-status = verified.
AVerify refines APlan.
Delivery requires Api in mode Offline.
Delivery requires SparePort in mode Online.
Desktop consumes Api.
Desktop owns Display.
Desktop provides Delivery.
Display allocated-to Local in mode Offline.
Display allocated-to Remote in mode Online.
Display contributes-to Navigation.
Display realizes Delivery.
Local contains Desktop.
Navigation supports Browse.
Reader pursues Browse.
Reader pursues Export.
Remote consumes Api.
